Traefik GeoIP2 plugin (github.com/sopov/traefikgeoip2)

This product is an independently maintained derivative of
github.com/GiGInnovationLabs/traefikgeoip2 by GiG Innovation Labs, by way of
the fork github.com/nuki-io/traefikgeoip2 by nuki-io. Both are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0, and were themselves started from the Traefik
plugin template (Copyright 2020 Containous SAS, Copyright 2020 Traefik Labs),
whose copyright line is retained in LICENSE.

Modifications in this repository (middleware.go, types.go, registry.go,
cache.go, clientip.go, logger.go, the tests, the build and CI files and the
documentation) add database sharing and reloading, a bounded result cache, ASN
database support, additional headers, configurable client-address handling and
per-instance logging. See the git history for details.

Third-party components:

- github.com/IncSW/geoip2 (MIT), vendored with the modifications described in
  patches/README.md; its licence is in vendor/github.com/IncSW/geoip2/LICENSE.
- MaxMind test databases in testdata/ (Copyright MaxMind, Inc., Apache-2.0 or
  MIT at your option); see testdata/README.md.
